0 and " [:a {:href "/athletes/82240"} "Ute Rührold"] " in 1972. These two lugers, both from SC Traktor Oberwiesenthal, would compete for the gold in Sapporo, together with a third East German, " [:a {:href "/athletes/82313"} "Margit Schumann"] ". Competition started with a tie in the first run between Schumann and Rührold, but Müller grabbed the lead with a strong second descent. Schumann won the third run, leaving her 0.12 seconds between the three (Müller ahead of Rührold and Schumann) at three-quarters of the competition. Müller, who had missed a silver medal in 1968 because of a disqualification, did not give away her position and won the final run. Müller might have won more international medals if she would have competed on Sundays, but a strict Catholic, she always refused this."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {} "Run #1"] [:th {} "Run #2"] [:th {} "Run #3"] [:th {} "Run #4"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/81894"} "Anna-Maria Müller"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "2:59.18"] [:td {} "45.00 (3)"] [:td {} "45.00 (1)"] [:td {} "44.86 (3)"] [:td {} "44.32 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/82240"} "Ute Rührold"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "2:59.49"] [:td {} "44.95 (=1)"] [:td {} "45.23 (2)"] [:td {} "44.76 (2)"] [:td {} "44.55 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/82313"} "